&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In a nutshell&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us in designing the future of grocery shopping. As a Product Designer in our consumer team, you&#39;ll own the design of our core mobile app, shaping the daily shopping experience for hundreds of thousands of people in The Netherlands, Germany and France. You&#39;ll tackle the unique challenge of designing for a task that is frequent, personal, and central to our customers&#39; lives. You&#39;ll be part of a dedicated product team and our wider UX Guild, a creative community that ensures a world-class user experience across Picnic. We’re looking for a passionate designer to join our Amsterdam HQ and help build a product people genuinely love, in a fast-scaling environment that values autonomy, collaboration, and adaptability over rigid processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tricks of the trade&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have the autonomy to own the design of new features from beginning to end. Everything you do matters and will be developed and tested at a fast pace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sharpen project briefs based on explorative research together with UX researchers and product owners.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build low and high fidelity prototypes to be tested and evaluated on a weekly basis with real users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document the final design requirements on interaction and UI level to brief and support developers during the development phase.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn and grow through the continuous feedback and mentoring by seasoned UX designers and researchers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the development and maintenance of our design libraries and system.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously explore new ideas in order to initiate new projects and improvements, design is never done ;).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your superpowers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;You have a completed degree in a relevant design field (e.g. CMD, UX, Interaction or Product Design)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;You have 0-3 years of experience as a UX designer and have worked on or have a strong interest in building great products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Your portfolio has user-centered design cases that show your problem solving capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;You have a deep curiosity to understand our customers and have hands-on experience in exploratory research to discover and define user problems from scratch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;You know your way around Figma and are able to craft high-fidelity designs that fit into our design system&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;You bring a low-ego, collaborative mindset and enjoy building solutions together&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;You’re fluent in English and holder of an EU work permit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;You&#39;re open to work on-site fulltime&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Picnic perks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🥗Fresh Lunch, coffee, and snacks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our offices are equipped with fully-fledged coffee bars and a kitchen and chefs. They prepare delicious fresh and warm lunches every day so you can keep your energy up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚴🏼‍♂️Health insurance discount &amp;amp; bike plan&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a partnership with CZ (a health insurance provider). Picnic employees get a discount on CZ insurance packages between 5% and 15%. Furthermore, through our partnership with Lease a Bike, you can rent-to-own a new (e)bike at a discounted rate&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🏠 Relocation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re moving from another country to join Picnic we make it as smooth as possible for you. We’ll cover your flight costs for you and your partner and kids, your first month&#39;s rent and moving costs (up to €2000), and help you with the 30% tax ruling setup and application.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✍🏼 Learning &amp;amp; development&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll get ample opportunity to work on yourself at Picnic. We offer personal development through Lepaya courses, Academy trainings, and more. Interested in improving your mental wellbeing? Through OpenUp you get free access to trained psychologists and many courses.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;All the rest&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Picnic you get 25 holidays, we cover your travel expenses and offer a pension plan. And your phone and laptop are on us, as well.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Orcrist is building a next generation data intelligence platform using cutting-edge technologies. We&#39;re handling petabyte-scale data with sub-second queries. Our product is a Kubernetes‑based platform delivered as B2B SaaS or as a self‑hosted on‑prem solution, including air‑gapped deployments. We enable customers across defense, law enforcement, and enterprise to turn mission-critical data into actionable intelligence.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a (Senior) Program Manager to join our Business/Government Development team. In this role, you&#39;ll own the entire path from a prioritized opportunity to a successfully delivered and scalable customer program. You will translate customer needs into concrete project concepts and prototypes, leading delivery across defense, security, and public-sector environments while bridging the gap between capture, product, and operational users.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Convert prioritized leads and customer needs into concrete, funded project opportunities together with Government Development, Business Development, and Product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with public-sector customers and operational users to understand complex operational problems, user needs, and procurement logic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structure and coordinate prototypes, demonstrators, minimum viable products (MVPs), and pilot projects with clear test scenarios and decision milestones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take end-to-end responsibility for program delivery post-award, managing scope, timeline, budget, technical implementation, dependencies, and risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain trusted relationships with users, decision-makers, procurement bodies, and external technology or consortium partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document customer feedback and operational insights systematically, translating them into product decisions and reusable platform capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish binding governance, reporting, and decision-making structures to ensure contractual obligations and customer expectations are consistently met.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of relevant professional experience in program management, project management, innovation management, solution delivery, or technical business development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of converting early leads or customer needs into funded projects and delivering complex, cross-functional customer programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable experience in defense, security, government, or comparably regulated public-sector environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience structuring pilot projects or prototypes with technical teams and operational users, especially where requirements are not fully defined upfront.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial mindset with strong ownership, structured execution, and the ability to connect strategic objectives with operational delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business fluent German and English (C1+).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel regularly (approx. 30–40% within Germany and Europe).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work authorization in Germany and willingness to undergo a security clearance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What We Offer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remote-first, Germany-wide: &lt;/strong&gt;Work from wherever you do your best work, with regular team gatherings in Berlin and other off-site locations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexibility by default: &lt;/strong&gt;Flexible working hours help you make work fit your life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your setup, your way: &lt;/strong&gt;Get a personal home-office equipment budget to create a workspace that works for you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;30 days of vacation: &lt;/strong&gt;Take the time you need to recharge and come back with fresh energy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Keep growing: &lt;/strong&gt;We invest in your personal and professional development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Get rewarded for impact: &lt;/strong&gt;Performance bonuses are tied to agreed objectives and key results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A warm welcome: &lt;/strong&gt;Every new team member gets a welcome goodie bag.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Good people, good times: &lt;/strong&gt;From summer and Christmas parties to regular team gatherings, we make time to celebrate together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A mission that matters: &lt;/strong&gt;Work on challenges with tangible impact on public safety and national security.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Welcome to Planet. We believe in using space to help life on Earth.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Planet designs, builds, and operates the largest constellation of imaging satellites in history. This constellation delivers an unprecedented dataset of empirical information via a revolutionary cloud-based platform to authoritative figures in commercial, environmental, and humanitarian sectors. We are both a space company and data company all rolled into one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Customers and users across the globe use Planet&#39;s data to develop new technologies, drive revenue, power research, and solve our world’s toughest obstacles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we control every component of hardware design, manufacturing, data processing, and software engineering, our office is a truly inspiring mix of experts from a variety of domains.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a people-centric approach toward culture and community and we strive to iterate in a way that puts our team members first and prepares our company for growth. Join Planet and be a part of our mission to change the way people see the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Planet is a global company with employees working remotely world wide and joining us from offices in San Francisco, Washington DC, Germany, Austria, Slovenia, and The Netherlands.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Planet is expanding its platform capabilities to support customers who require dedicated, in-region, or on-premises instantiations of our core platform. As the Senior Product Manager for Sovereign &amp;amp; Hybrid Deployments, you will drive the productization of our platform for isolated, air-gapped, and hybrid environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will serve as the critical bridge between high-touch enterprise customer delivery and scalable core engineering. In this role, you will balance deep customer empathy with product discipline—translating complex operational requirements into repeatable core platform capabilities while establishing clear extension points for Professional Services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a full-time, hybrid role which will require you to work from our Berlin, Haarlem or Ljubljana office 3 days per week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact You’ll Own:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct deep-dive discovery with high-security enterprise and government stakeholders to understand their operational realities, using those insights to set clear, defensible product priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and structure the explicit, phased customer journey framework—establishing the operational models, readiness criteria, and governance standards for initial platform installation, joint-operations training, and the final transition into fully autonomous, customer-operated environments with zero or limited vendor access.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate customer operational and security requirements into clear technical specifications for Core Infrastructure and Engineering teams with detail-oriented accuracy. Synthesizes underlying commonalities across clients who describe similar operational needs using different language, preventing costly, redundant engineering effort.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define standardized building blocks that allow the core platform to extend safely into varying edge and air-gapped environments without hardcoding custom variants for every deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define clear boundaries for what belongs in the core platform versus what can be customized. Design clear hooks and interfaces so Professional Services and integration partners can build custom extensions without modifying core platform code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of relevant work experience in Technical Product Management focusing on enterprise platforms, hybrid cloud deployments, or complex infrastructure products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to sit down with enterprise or government clients, listen to complex operational workflows, and identify the root problem behind divergent customer terminology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record productizing cloud-native software platforms to deploy into customer-managed infrastructure, enterprise VPCs, or air-gapped data centers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to apply conceptual understanding of enterprise hybrid patterns similar to AWS Outposts, Azure Stack, Kubernetes-based enterprise distribution platforms (e.g., Red Hat OpenShift), or infrastructure automation frameworks (e.g., HashiCorp Terraform/Vault).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience setting clear boundaries between core platform roadmap items and custom extensions delivered by Professional Services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail-oriented mindset capable of mapping out complex operational transitions, training milestones, and access handoffs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Makes You Stand Out:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience navigating European sovereign cloud frameworks, regional data residency mandates, or EU defense/government compliance standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Deadline:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;11:45p / 23:45 CET on the date stated below. Applications are reviewed on a rolling basis. This posting may be removed earlier than projected if a suitable pool of applications has been received. For this reason, we recommend applying as soon as you are able to.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits While Working at Planet:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;These offerings are dependent on employment type and geographical location, based upon applicable law or company policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid time off including vacation, holidays and company-wide days off&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Wellness Program&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home Office Reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly Phone and Internet Reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tuition Reimbursement and access to LinkedIn Learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Volunteering Paid Time Off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The expected starting gross salary range for this role is listed below. Individual placement within this range is determined objectively based on gender-neutral criteria such as your skills, qualifications, and professional experience. This position may also be eligible for discretionary bonuses and/or equity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Netherlands Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€75.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€93.700 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Pursuant to the San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance, we will consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why we care so much about Belonging.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We’re dedicated to helping the whole Planet, and to do that we must strive to represent all of it within each of our offices and on all of our teams. That’s why Planet is guided by an ultimate north star of Belonging—dreaming big as we approach our ongoing work.&amp;nbsp; If this job intrigues you, but you’re thinking you might not have all the qualifications, please... do apply!&amp;nbsp; At Planet, we are looking for well-rounded people from around the world who can contribute to more ways than just what is listed in this job description.&amp;nbsp; We don’t just fill positions, we aspire to fulfill people’s careers, most excited about folks who are motivated by our underlying humanitarian efforts.&amp;nbsp; We are a few orbits around the sun before we get to where we want to be, so we hope you’re excited to come along for the ride.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
