&lt;h1 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Forward Deployed Engineer&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About HSO&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HSO is a global Business Transformation Partner with deep industry expertise and a long standing strategic relationship with Microsoft. We help organisations unlock the full potential of Microsoft Dynamics 365, Azure, Data and AI technologies to modernise operations, accelerate innovation and deliver meaningful business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In 2026, HSO achieved Microsoft Frontier Partner status, recognising our advanced capabilities across Microsoft Cloud and AI and our ability to help customers move beyond AI experimentation into secure, governed, enterprise scale production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With operations across Europe, North America and Asia, we combine industry knowledge, technical excellence and a practical, people first approach to transformation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we continue to expand our AI capabilities, we’re building a new generation of customer facing engineering talent to help organisations turn the potential of AI and agentic technologies into real, measurable value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HSO is building a new generation of customer facing engineers who will help our customers create the operating model of the future using the latest AI, data and cloud capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Forward Deployed Engineers combine consulting judgement, production software engineering, data platform expertise, AI delivery capability and business transformation skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will embed with strategic customers, understand their most important business challenges and rapidly turn those challenges into working, production ready AI applications, agentic workflows, automation solutions and data driven platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands on, outcome led role embedded within customer environments. You’ll move quickly from discovery to working software and take accountability for delivering measurable business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work across business processes, data platforms, integrations, AI, cloud and security, designing solutions that make effective use of Microsoft technologies while integrating with the customer’s wider technology estate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A strong understanding of modern enterprise data platforms is fundamental to the role. You will need to understand how data is structured, governed, integrated, transformed and made available to AI and application workloads, and how data platform decisions affect the quality, scalability and reliability of the solutions you build.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Forward Deployed Engineers work closely with Deployment Strategists. The Deployment Strategist focuses on identifying where AI can create the greatest customer value and defining the desired outcome. The FDE takes ownership of how that outcome is delivered technically.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From discovery through to go live, both roles work side by side. The FDE owns the technical solution and delivery, while the Deployment Strategist ensures the solution remains aligned to the business problem and measurable value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role does not end at first deployment. You’ll stay close to solutions through hardening, adoption and handover before moving on to the next value opportunity. You’ll also turn what you learn into reusable HSO assets, reference architectures and delivery patterns that help future engagements move faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Own Customer Outcomes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Embed rapidly within customer teams and develop a strong understanding of their priorities, operating processes, systems, data and constraints.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Translate ambiguous business problems and defined customer outcomes into clear technical delivery plans.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Act as the technical lead throughout an engagement, guiding customer sponsors, business users, technical teams and HSO colleagues towards successful delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Build trusted relationships with senior operational and technical stakeholders, including CTO and CIO level leaders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Take ownership for delivering solutions that create measurable customer value rather than simply completing technical tasks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Lead Discovery and Solution Design&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Lead technical discovery workshops to understand customer challenges and identify high value AI, data and automation opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Assess business processes, data readiness, data architecture, integration points, security requirements, technical risks and operational constraints.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Understand the customer’s existing data platform landscape and identify how data needs to be accessed, transformed, governed or modernised to support the required solution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Apply a problem first approach to identify the smallest valuable solution that can be built and proven quickly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Design end to end solution architectures that balance speed, scalability, maintainability, security and responsible AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Turn discovery into a pragmatic roadmap from prototype through to production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Build and Ship Production Solutions&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Design, build, integrate, test and deploy enterprise grade solutions using modern cloud, data and AI technologies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Develop AI powered applications, copilots, agents, automations, integrations and workflow solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Build solutions that make effective use of modern enterprise data platforms and ensure AI applications are supported by reliable, governed and accessible data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Integrate solutions with platforms such as Microsoft Fabric, Azure Data Services, Dynamics 365, Power Platform, Salesforce, SAP, ServiceNow and customer owned systems, APIs and data platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Apply modern engineering practices including source control, CI/CD, automated testing, infrastructure as code, observability and secure development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Work iteratively. Deliver value quickly, learn from real world usage and progressively harden solutions for enterprise production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Engineer AI and Agentic Solutions&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Design and implement robust agentic workflows, human in the loop processes and, where appropriate, multi agent architectures.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Apply modern techniques across retrieval, grounding, orchestration, tool integration, context engineering and evaluation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Build evaluation frameworks and guardrails to test AI behaviour, reliability and quality before and after deployment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Implement appropriate responsible AI, security, monitoring and governance controls.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Ensure data quality, lineage, governance and availability are considered as fundamental components of AI solution design.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Use operational data and user feedback to continuously improve solution quality and performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Create Reusable HSO Capability&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Reuse existing HSO assets, accelerators and delivery patterns wherever they improve speed and quality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Turn lessons from customer engagements into reusable assets, reference architectures, engineering patterns and playbooks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Contribute actively to HSO’s AI, Data, Frontier and Horizon engineering communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Share practical knowledge across regions, practices and delivery teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Support and mentor other engineers as the Forward Deployed Engineering capability grows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for experienced engineers who combine strong technical depth with commercial awareness and the ability to operate confidently with customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll ideally bring:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Significant experience across software engineering, cloud engineering, data engineering, solution development, technical consulting or enterprise technology delivery, with senior level ownership of complex solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Strong hands on experience building and operating production grade solutions on at least one major cloud platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Strong understanding and practical experience of modern enterprise data platforms, including data architecture, integration, transformation, governance and the role data plays in enabling AI and application workloads.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Experience with Microsoft data technologies such as Microsoft Fabric, Azure Data Factory, Azure Synapse, Azure Databricks, OneLake or comparable enterprise data platforms would be highly valuable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Excellent coding capability in a modern language such as Python, C#, TypeScript, JavaScript or Java, with a track record of producing maintainable, production quality software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Practical experience designing, building and deploying AI powered applications using platforms such as Azure AI, OpenAI, AWS Bedrock, Google Vertex AI, Anthropic or comparable technologies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Hands on experience with large language models, prompting, retrieval augmented generation, evaluation and agent orchestration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Strong understanding of APIs, integrations, data platforms and modern distributed application architectures.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Experience with modern engineering and DevOps practices including CI/CD, automated testing, source control and infrastructure as code.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Strong customer facing experience in consulting, transformation, delivery or technical leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• The ability to work effectively where requirements are incomplete, priorities evolve quickly and the right answer is not immediately obvious.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• The judgement to balance engineering excellence with speed, practicality and customer value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You do not need to be an expert in every technology we use. More important is the ability to learn quickly, understand unfamiliar environments and apply strong engineering and data fundamentals to new problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Certifications across Microsoft Azure, Microsoft Fabric, AWS, Google Cloud or leading AI platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Experience working with enterprise platforms such as Dynamics 365, Power Platform, Salesforce, SAP, ServiceNow or similar.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Experience implementing responsible AI, AI governance, evaluation frameworks or model monitoring in enterprise environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Experience designing or delivering modern data platforms that support analytics, operational applications or AI workloads.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Experience across industries such as Manufacturing, Retail, Financial Services, Public Sector or Professional Services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• A track record of turning successful customer solutions into reusable patterns or accelerators.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Experience leading small, highly capable engineering teams from discovery through to production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why Join HSO?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI is changing how organisations operate, but most businesses do not need more demonstrations or isolated pilots. They need people who can identify where AI will genuinely create value, ensure the underlying data foundations are fit for purpose and then build something that works in production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;That is what this role is designed to do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Forward Deployed Engineer at HSO, you’ll work directly with strategic customers at the point where emerging AI, data and cloud capabilities meet real business problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll have the opportunity to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Build real AI products and solutions rather than proof of concepts that never reach production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Work across AI, cloud and data platforms to solve complex customer problems end to end.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Work directly with senior customer stakeholders and see the impact of what you build.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Operate at the forefront of Microsoft’s evolving AI and Data ecosystem as part of a Microsoft Frontier Partner.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Work across technologies, industries and business problems rather than being confined to a single product or platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Help shape a new engineering capability within HSO rather than stepping into a narrowly defined existing model.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Turn successful customer work into reusable technology and approaches that can scale across HSO globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll join a senior, practical and customer focused team that values ownership, curiosity, engineering quality, speed and measurable impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Compensation and Benefits&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer a competitive base salary alongside HSO’s standard employee benefits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role will also include a performance related element designed to recognise both individual contribution and the value created through successful customer delivery. Further details on the compensation structure and performance measures will be discussed during the recruitment process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT ROCKET LAB&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rocket Lab is the end-to-end space company building rockets, spacecraft, and critical subsystems that keep the world connected, protected, expand humanity’s reach to the Moon, Mars, and beyond. We move fast, build real hardware for meaningful missions, and make the impossible routine. Come shape the future with us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DIRECTOR – EUROPEAN GOVERNMENT OPERATIONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Director – European Government Operations, based in &lt;strong&gt;Munich/ Berlin, &lt;/strong&gt;Germany, you will lead Rocket Lab’s government affairs strategy across Germany and the broader European region. You will play a critical role in advancing Rocket Lab’s business objectives by shaping policy environments, building strategic government relationships, and ensuring alignment between Government Affairs and Business Development. In this role, you will work at the intersection of aerospace innovation, national security, and European public-sector engagement. To be successful, you must be results‑oriented, proactive, politically astute, and deeply comfortable operating in complex, fast‑moving environments. Join a driven team of pioneers relentlessly tackling challenging projects, delivering on the impossible, and making an impact on the future of space.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL GET TO DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and lead Rocket Lab’s in‑house European Government Operations function, delivering the same level of strategic support and government engagement the company receives in the U.S. market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and lead Rocket Lab’s government affairs strategy in Germany and across Europe, ensuring alignment with corporate priorities and business development objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain high‑impact relationships with key German federal stakeholders, including the Bundestag, DLR, Ministry of Defense, and relevant regulatory and executive agencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and grow Rocket Lab’s presence with government entities and innovation ecosystems in Munich and other strategic European hubs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with the Business Development team to support market expansion, customer engagement, and pursuit of government‑funded programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape and influence policy discussions related to space, defense, launch, and emerging technologies, ensuring Rocket Lab’s interests are represented and understood&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide strategic guidance on political, regulatory, and industrial‑policy developments across Europe, identifying opportunities and risks for business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Rocket Lab in industry associations, working groups, and public‑sector forums to strengthen the company’s visibility and credibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive measurable business outcomes through targeted government engagement not only monitoring policy trends but actively shaping them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a trusted advisor to senior leadership on European political dynamics, defense priorities, and government procurement pathways&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOU’LL BRING THESE QUALIFICATIONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in political science, international relations, public policy, law, economics, engineering, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years of experience in government affairs, public policy, defense, aerospace, or related strategic roles within Germany or Europe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional fluency in German and English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success building and managing relationships with senior government officials, policymakers, and public‑sector institutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to drive business‑aligned outcomes through government engagement, not solely policy monitoring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of European political structures, defense priorities, and government procurement processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to operate autonomously, set strategy, and execute in a fast‑paced, high‑growth environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication, negotiation, and stakeholder‑management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THESE QUALIFICATIONS WOULD BE NICE TO HAVE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in space, aerospace, defense, or dual‑use technology sectors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with or within institutions such as DLR, MOD, Bundestag committees, EU defense bodies, or national innovation agencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior roles in business development, defense industrial policy, or public‑sector consulting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in Munich’s government, defense, or technology ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with NATO, EU defense initiatives, and cross‑border industrial‑cooperation frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;u&gt;This position may require prolonged periods of sitting, standing, walking, computer work, and occasional exposure to moderate levels of noise, dust, and fumes in production areas&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;WHAT TO EXPECT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to unlock the potential of space to improve life on Earth, but that’s not an easy task. It takes hard work, determination, relentless innovation, teamwork, grit, and an unwavering commitment to achieving what others often deem impossible. Our people out-think, out-work, and out-pace. We pride ourselves on having each other’s backs, checking our egos at the door, and rolling up our sleeves on all tasks big and small. We thrive under pressure, work to tight deadlines, and our focus is always on how we can deliver, rather than dwelling on the challenges that stand in the way.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Important information:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FOR CANDIDATES SEEKING TO WORK IN US OFFICES ONLY:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;To conform to U.S. Government space technology export regulations, including the International Traffic in Arms Regulations (ITAR), Rocket Lab Employees must be a U.S. citizen, lawful U.S. permanent resident (i.e., current Green Card holder), or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum, or be eligible to obtain the required authorizations from the U.S. Department of State and/or the U.S. Department of Commerce, as applicable. Learn more about ITAR &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.us/v2/url?u=https-3A__www.pmddtc.state.gov_-3Fid-3Dddtc-5Fkb-5Farticle-5Fpage-26sys-5Fid-3D24d528fddbfc930044f9ff621f961987&amp;amp;d=DwMFog&amp;amp;c=N_fLK0KxmM34zjMadXHMx_SQYmXWO3FX0MRVr1hBcn4&amp;amp;r=prjnch9sxomG2ahCicblmM3m-FuPObepspoR1qvWq2I&amp;amp;m=ExC44mBPk2emo4Fr0xPSGZN0UraQ1ZtkDTxwR7iWw5rixcFQb-Wjlv7lJcecLldz&amp;amp;s=0lfm4LyRtFwK220WHBK11DGHWSVvVhQEcfa5G_2Nf18&amp;amp;e=&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Rocket Lab provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local laws. This policy applies to all terms and conditions of employment at Rocket Lab, including recruiting, hiring, placement, promotion, termination, layoff, recall, transfer, leaves of absence, compensation, and training.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Applicants requiring a reasonable accommodation for the application/interview process for a job in the United States should contact Giulia Johnson at &lt;a ---------- dedicated resource is intended solely to assist job seekers with disabilities whose disability prevents them from being able to apply/interview. Only messages left for this purpose will be considered. A response to your request may take up to two business days.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FOR CANDIDATES SEEKING TO WORK IN NEW ZEALAND OFFICES ONLY:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;For security reasons, background checks will be undertaken prior to any employment offers being made to an applicant.&amp;nbsp; These checks will include nationality checks as it is a requirement of this position that you be eligible to access equipment and data regulated by the United States&#39; International Traffic in Arms Regulations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Under these Regulations, you may be ineligible for this role if you do not hold citizenship of Australia, Japan, New Zealand, Switzerland, the European Union, or a country that is part of NATO, or if you hold ineligible dual citizenship or nationality.&amp;nbsp; For more information on these Regulations, click here &lt;a class=&quot;fui-Link ___m14voj0 f3rmtva f1ern45e f1deefiw f1n71otn f1q5o8ev f1h8hb77 f1vxd6vx f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1hu3pq6 f11qmguv f19f4twv f1tyq0we f1g0x7ka fhxju0i f1qch9an f1cnd47f fqv5qza f1vmzxwi f1o700av f13mvf36 f9n3di6 f1ids18y fygtlnl f1deo86v f12x56k7 f1iescvh ftqa4ok f50u1b5 fs3pq8b f1hghxdh f1tymzes f1x7u7e9 f1cmlufx f10aw75t fsle3fq&quot; href=&quot;https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2020/01/23/2020-00574/international-traffic-in-arms-regulations-us-munitions-list-categories-i-ii-and-iii&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;ITAR Regulations.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Join us in our mission to transform the way people shop and eat, where impact, innovation, and growth drives everything we do. Our Brand &amp;amp; Experience team builds the emotional connection between Deliveroo and our customers, riders, and partners. With a deep understanding of our audience and a passion for creativity, we bring our brand to life across every touchpoint. Whether it’s a push notification, social campaign, or packaging design—we craft compelling experiences that shape perceptions, spark engagement, and make Deliveroo a loved, global brand.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;We’re looking for a Senior Marketing Manager, Brand Integrated Marketing to join our London team. This is a hybrid role. In this role, you’ll help us take ideas from global strategy through to local activation across markets, delivering integrated campaigns that drive measurable business growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;You’ll be joining the Integrated Marketing team. We own the Deliveroo brand globally and lead our biggest campaign moments. Working in a cross-functional squad alongside strategic teams, functional leads, and local markets, we turn big ideas into high-impact campaigns across our markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;Here’s what your day-to-day might look like:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Global Campaign Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead high-profile global marketing programmes and integrated campaigns from global strategy through to local market execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Framework &amp;amp; Playbook Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Design, scale, and maintain measurement frameworks, playbooks, and systems that enable global and local teams to execute best-in-class brand campaigns.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Cross-Functional Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with cross-functional squads, strategic teams, functional leads, and local market leads to align campaign strategies with core business goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Influence senior stakeholders across the global organisation without direct authority, ensuring alignment on messaging, execution, and performance metrics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Strategic Optimisation:&lt;/strong&gt; Balance tactical execution with a longer-term strategic perspective to solve complex marketing briefs and continuously optimize brand performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;What You’ll Need to Thrive&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Essential&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;11&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;11,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Integrated Brand Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven experience leading end-to-end global integrated marketing campaigns from initial strategy through to local market activation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;11,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Framework Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong track record in establishing measurement frameworks, campaign playbooks, and operational systems that scale across multiple regions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;11,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Stakeholder Influence:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated ability to influence and align senior cross-functional stakeholders and matrix teams without direct line management authority.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;11,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Strategic &amp;amp; Tactical Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to operate independently on complex or ambiguous briefs, balancing day-to-day execution with longer-term brand strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;11,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Commercial Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong expertise in linking brand initiatives and marketing campaigns directly to measurable business growth and commercial impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
